---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy | AInothing.top"
  description="Privacy policy for AInothing.top, including analytics, hosting logs, and how editorial correspondence is handled."
>
  <section class="policy-shell">
    <div class="policy-intro">
      <span class="section-label">Privacy policy</span>
      <h1>Simple policy for a small editorial site.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        AInothing.top is an informational website about AI, online businesses, and revenue case studies.
        If you voluntarily send a message to the site owner, that information is used only to review the
        message, reply when appropriate, and keep a basic editorial record of the exchange.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-grid">
      <article class="policy-card card-surface">
        <h2>What data may exist</h2>
        <p>
          Like most websites, the live host may record standard technical data such as IP address, browser type,
          referring page, and request timing for security, reliability, and performance monitoring.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card card-surface">
        <h2>Analytics and feeds</h2>
        <p>
          AInothing.top may use lightweight analytics or RSS distribution tools to understand readership at an aggregate level.
          This is intended to improve the editorial product, not to build detailed personal profiles.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card card-surface">
        <h2>Advertising and third parties</h2>
        <p>
          If advertising, embeds, or other third-party services are added later, those providers may use their own cookies
          or measurement technologies according to their policies. This page should be updated if the site begins using them.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="policy-card card-surface">
        <h2>Contact and updates</h2>
        <p>
          Because this is a small editorial project, the policy is intentionally short. If the site's data practices change,
          the page should be revised so readers can see the new scope clearly.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .policy-shell {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    padding: 1rem 0 0.8rem;
  }

  .policy-intro {
    max-width: 52rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .policy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-card {
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .policy-card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .policy-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .policy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
